svn-docker 3.0.0 — NOTICE

This project (version 3.0.0 and later) is an independent implementation:
a Go REST API (api/) plus a rspack/Vue 3/Tailwind SPA (web/) served through
Apache mod_dav_svn. It contains no PHP and no original iF.SVNAdmin source code.

